         "threadId": "design-home-thread-sarah",
         "parentId": "design-home-reply-sarah-r3",
         "bodyHtml": "<p>Kept them. Niagara supervises the old controllers and maps their points over BACnet/IP, so nothing had to be ripped out.</p>",
         "moderation": "APPROVED",
         "author": {
          "id": "design-home-user-arvind",
