  {
   "id": "design-home-reply-sarah-f12",
   "threadId": "design-home-thread-sarah",
   "parentId": null,
   "bodyHtml": "<p>Peak-hour control needs demand forecasting, not just sensors. Ask vendors how they handle pre-cooling.</p>",
